{"c":[{"id":"d256a1d69439332b","sum":"Skip test_coverage_collection (removes torch). Zstd: persistent or no .wal; replay Uncompressed. L4 PR drops active/; restore from main, rebase on squash; merge rebase drops bank. Docs as-is. Arch: cutoffs+schema snapshot, not filenames/versions. Make tables=indexes. STE100.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"2bb07e0a9d672229","sum":"Skip test_coverage_collection to keep torch; its coverage-engine sync removes torch. Zstd: filter persistent or no .wal; replayed rows persistent=false Uncompressed; persistent segments ZSTD. Puck 09ea4ae: copy stayed v1.0.0+, no index; 1.5.4 wrote, 2.0.0 read; inode unchanged.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"04ad6c4e13eff575","sum":"Full pytest drops torch via test_coverage_collection make coverage-engine exact sync. Later: No module named torch.distributed; ensure-env, then rerun. Zstd check: filter persistent or no .wal. Replayed rows persistent=false Uncompressed; persistent segments are ZSTD.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T144151Z-19beeb928bb79a4a","text":"Measured 2026-10-23: a bare full pytest run in a torch-provisioned checkout drops torch midway: test_coverage_collection runs make coverage-engine, whose sync is exact. Later torch-gated tests fail (No module named torch.distributed); ensure-env, then rerun them.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T152930Z-94e11b6c634d81a7","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-23: a zstd-column file opened read-only with a .wal (killed ingest) lists the replayed rows in pragma_storage_info as persistent=false, Uncompressed; every persistent segment is ZSTD. A zstd check must filter persistent or run with no .wal.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c67ab4511ba06727","sum":"pytest --ignore=tests/test_coverage_collection.py keeps torch; only that module make coverage-engine exact sync removes it. Puck step 8.4 at 09ea4ae exited 0 in 43s: shadow copy stayed v1.0.0+, schema head, no index. DuckDB 1.5.4 wrote it and 2.0.0 read it. Live inode unchanged.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T154646Z-7f876ab5674122fe","text":"QA 2026-10-23: in a torch-provisioned live checkout, pytest --ignore=tests/test_coverage_collection.py runs the rest of the suite and keeps torch; only that module's make coverage-engine runs the exact sync that removes it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T164313Z-a987fa985b63d02d","text":"Puck step 8.4 at 09ea4ae exited 0 in 43s: shadow copy stayed v1.0.0+, schema head, no index. DuckDB 1.5.4 wrote it and 2.0.0 read it. Live warehouse inode unchanged.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"beb7790cb872e159","sum":"L4 PR tip drops memory-bank/active (Fresh; unmerged). Restore from main, rebase onto squash; merge rebase drops bank. Docs as-is; history separate/omitted; Make tables=indexes; STE100 steps. Arch: cutoffs+schema snapshot, not filenames or versions. Schema-docs: diagram sources.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"cb6ae39a5d37dae5","sum":"L4 release PR is a child whose tip drops memory-bank/active, so main stays a Fresh /niko checkout. Do not merge that child back. After land, restore memory-bank/active onto a branch from main. Rebase onto the squash. A merge-commit rebase ends on main and drops the memory bank.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T170937Z-2ed4854315f18992","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: a mid-L4 release PR is a child of the working branch whose tip drops memory-bank/active, so main stays a Fresh /niko checkout. Do not merge that child back; the deletion would remove the working memory bank.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T174008Z-2f2719b3d24475d2","text":"After PR 150 lands, restore memory-bank/active from constrain-size-as-best-we-can onto a branch from main. Rebase onto the squash conflicts; a merge-commit rebase ends on main and drops the memory bank.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8afc0a8c1d95c4dc","sum":"Operator 2026-10-23: docs state the current system; history separate or omitted. Make tables are indexes. Procedures are numbered STE100 steps. Architecture states migration cutoffs and the schema snapshot, not filenames or schema versions. Schema-docs names diagram's sources.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T185340Z-f0241d50f37fdbf8","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: user-facing docs describe the system as it is. History gets its own section or is omitted. Make tables are indexes. Critical procedures are short numbered STE100 steps.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T192936Z-7fa70422db429591","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: architecture states migration cutoffs and the schema snapshot, not filenames or schema versions. Contributing schema-docs says the diagram is generated and which sources to edit.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"6bdde57d42dff9a0","sum":"Mechanism before branch (unloaded dep, or SQL cannot). No schema versions. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can. live_bytes persistent block ids drop <0; 'free disk' one phrase; copy leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb; apply_pending through; no view-SQL compare across versions.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"beb30012ff315032","sum":"Cutoff: name the mechanism before the branch (unloaded dependency, or SQL cannot make the result). No schema version numbers. After a diagram, say why each branch exists, then the mechanics. Repeat the noun. v3.0.0 is c9fbcc4, PR 151. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"33748c759245c163","sum":"Migration cutoff: say the mechanism before the branch. A step can need a dependency the engine will not load, or SQL cannot make the result. No schema version numbers. After a diagram, walk each branch and say why before the mechanics. Repeat the noun; no 'that step' or 'it'.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T194315Z-636df94295e2a95b","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: explain a migration cutoff by the mechanism. A step can need a dependency the engine will not load, or the result can be something SQL cannot make. Say that before the branch. Do not use schema version numbers.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T194731Z-18fb669bc11e2a93","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: after a diagram, walk each branch and say why before the mechanics. Repeat the noun. Do not use 'that step' or 'it' for something named earlier.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4aec4ac4f2b51149","sum":"2026-10-23: M1-M3 shipped as v3.0.0 (c9fbcc4) via release-please PR 151. warehouse-file-growth restored memory-bank/active from the old branch onto main. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T210428Z-bfb74039999452c2","text":"2026-10-23: M1-M3 are on main as squash 0e1e62e. Ship them as v3.0.0 by merging release-please PR 151 before milestone 4. Then restore memory-bank/active onto a new branch from that main. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T211708Z-b30e35daac19f4be","text":"2026-10-23: v3.0.0 is c9fbcc4. warehouse-file-growth restores memory-bank/active from constrain-size-as-best-we-can. Milestone 3 is checked. Milestone 4 is Level 2, the read-only doctor storage report. Do not rebase the old branch.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"570fa3f21488d2c5","sum":"live_bytes unions persistent block ids, dropping ids below 0. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase. copy_warehouse leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb; apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c23945751b6b1fca","sum":"live_bytes is the union of persistent block ids, ids below 0 dropped. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T220226Z-0a3553df5a1ac252","text":"2026-10-23: warehouse-file-growth at 36b3c4d is main plus the memory bank. Milestone 4 doctor storage report passed preflight with an advisory. live_bytes stays the union of persistent block ids, dropping ids below 0. Build has not started.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T224558Z-a0c4edb3a448542b","text":"argparse's default help formatter replaces a space with a newline, so a two-word --help assertion can fail. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"54a433b5bbf07253","sum":"copy_warehouse leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb. apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261024T001536Z-49fa9d2f5324eb68","text":"2026-10-23: Milestone 4 doctor storage report is checked after reflect. Milestone 5 verified newer-format copy is Level 3. Plan has not started.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261024T002339Z-883a096b1bb38717","text":"2026-10-23: Milestone 5 plan writes copy_warehouse, which leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb. apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions. Preflight has not run.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
